sequenceDiagram
    participant DSPO as DSPO<br/>(Operator)
    participant Init as Init Container<br/>(pipelines-components)
    participant Volume as Shared Volume<br/>(/config/managed-pipelines)
    participant KFP as KFP API Server
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>(CRD)
    participant EvalHub as Eval Hub<br/>HTTPS
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Init,Volume: Flow 1: Managed Pipeline Staging
    DSPO->>Init: Inject RELATED_IMAGE_* env vars (optional)
    Init->>Init: Read /app/managed-pipelines.json
    alt RELATED_IMAGE_* present
        Init->>Init: Recompile pipelines with operator-controlled images
    end
    Init->>Volume: Copy compiled pipeline YAMLs
    KFP->>Volume: Read managed pipeline definitions

    Note over HF,ModelReg: Flow 2: LLM Fine-Tuning Pipeline
    KFP->>HF: Download dataset<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>KFP: Dataset artifacts
    KFP->>S3: Download dataset/model<br/>Auth: AWS creds
    S3-->>KFP: Dataset/model artifacts
    KFP->>KFP: Train model (SFT/LoRA/OSFT)
    KFP->>K8s: Create ServingRuntime CR<br/>Auth: SA Bearer Token
    K8s-->>KServe: ServingRuntime created
    KFP->>K8s: Create InferenceService CR<br/>Auth: SA Bearer Token
    K8s-->>KServe: InferenceService created
    KFP->>EvalHub: Submit evaluation job<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    EvalHub-->>KFP: Evaluation results
    KFP->>ModelReg: Register trained model<br/>No Auth
    ModelReg-->>KFP: Registration confirmed

    Note over S3,KServe: Flow 3: AutoRAG Pipeline
    KFP->>S3: Discover documents<br/>Auth: AWS creds
    S3-->>KFP: Raw documents
    KFP->>KFP: Extract text (Docling / Whisper)
    KFP->>KFP: Index documents (Milvus / PGVector)
    KFP->>KFP: Optimize RAG templates (ai4rag)
    KFP->>K8s: Create InferenceService CR<br/>Auth: SA Bearer Token
    K8s-->>KServe: AutoRAG agent deployed
